    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“enforcement respondent” means a party against whom an enforcement order is sought or made"

DECLARE `o 22 r 1 kind of movable property` IS ONE OF
    `o 22 r 1 cash`
    `o 22 r 1 a debt`
    `o 22 r 1 a deposit of money`
    `o 22 r 1 bonds, shares or other securities`
    `o 22 r 1 membership in a club or society`
