DECLARE `o 22 r 2(4) item` IS ONE OF
    `o 22 r 2(4)(a) the terms of the Court order`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(b) the enforcement respondent's name and address`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(c) the date that the Court order was served on the enforcement respondent`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(d) the terms of the Court order which have not been complied with and which are to be enforced`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(e) the reasons for the delay in the application`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(f) the change in the identity of the enforcement applicant or the enforcement respondent`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(g) the amount due, the amount recovered from any security, the amount paid and the amount that remains owing`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(h) the amount of interest owing daily from the time of making the affidavit`
