    `o 22 r 2(4)(k) the description of the deposit of money or debt and the evidence that it belongs or is due to the enforcement respondent`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(l) whether the Sheriff is to enforce the parts of the enforcement order in a particular sequence or simultaneously`
    `o 22 r 2(4)(m) the undertaking`

-- (4): "must state": (a) to (d), (l) and (m) always; (e) to (k) each only where its own condition holds.
