    `period length` IS 14
    `period unit` IS Days
    `period direction` IS `Before the anchor`

-- (4): "Unless the Court otherwise directs, the summons must be served on the enforcement respondent at least 14 days
-- before the day named in the summons for the hearing of it": the last day is the O 3 r 3 count back from the hearing.
-- src:3447 | (4) Unless the Court otherwise directs, the summons must be served on the enforcement respondent at least 14 days before the day named in the summons for the hearing of it.
