        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "Unless the Court otherwise directs" and the direction's terms are not in the Rules
        IF `the date the summons is served on the enforcement respondent` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "at least 14 days before the day named in the summons for the hearing of it" [period, ruled 2026-11-05 (a)]

-- (5): "Subject to Order 33, Rule 25" (a seam: Order 33 rule 25 is in another part).
-- src:3448 | (5) Subject to Order 33, Rule 25, the Court hearing an application under this Rule may make such order with respect to the money in Court as it thinks just.
@ref O 22 r 5(5) (src:3448-3448)
