      `o 33 r 25 the Court's power to make an order with respect to the money in Court is changed` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 22 r 5(5) the Court may make such order with respect to the money in Court as it thinks just` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the Court is hearing an application under this Rule`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the Court hearing an application under this Rule"
        IF `o 33 r 25 the Court's power to make an order with respect to the money in Court is changed` EQUALS JUST FALSE
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "Subject to Order 33, Rule 25" and what that rule changes is its answer
